        "type": "group"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "For coordination compounds or complexes with geometries other than octahedral, the same principles apply, but the specifics of the "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "d"
              },
              {
                "text": "-orbital splittings are different. The "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "d"
              },
              {
                "text": "-orbital energy level diagrams for tetrahedral and square planar complexes are shown below."
              }
            ],
            "id": "451142671",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "caption": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "Energies of the d orbitals in a tetrahedral crystal field."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2080814608",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "8o6ffpugzybg9d4",
                "text": ""
              }
            ],
            "display": "block",
            "height": 225.484375,
            "id": "4044615774",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/FE/FE8C20C6ECEC0C6CD83B2863D882630F/TetrahedralSplitting.png",
            "type": "img",
            "width": 550
          },
